<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. & Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol. colonial hydroid pulsatile gastrovascular stolon network, anastomosis loop closure, and runner-to-sheet morphospace (Hydractinia symbiolongicarpus / Podocoryna carnea (Colonial marine hydroids))",
        "Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. & Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol. colonial hydroid pulsatile gastrovascular stolon network, anastomosis loop closure, and runner-to-sheet morphospace faithfully reproduces Hydractinia symbiolongicarpus / Podocoryna carnea (Colonial marine hydroids) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2020-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Hydractinia symbiolongicarpus / Podocoryna carnea (Colonial marine hydroids) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 51.9/100, audit 2026-10-19-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2020-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net.py> ;
    schema:about "Hydractinia symbiolongicarpus / Podocoryna carnea (Colonial marine hydroids)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2020-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net.py; output: docs/media/hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net_comparison.png; organism: Hydractinia symbiolongicarpus / Podocoryna carnea (Colonial marine hydroids); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 89c0f33a7d88261f666404a05447dcbcee682836ef33db2cdc94324f94c96aa2; artifact_sha256: 08ee845e9749730b66c536156a27ccec1a38f396729cccb6dbc8bd94db099a6a; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net/hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net_reference.json=db4c51ae3bdeb00a..., datasets/hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net/hydractinia_symbiolongicarpus_specimen.jpg=059b83cd797d0516..., datasets/hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net/paper_citations.bib=44b19ab180b9e27a..., datasets/hydractinia_stolon_vascular_net/scout_manifest.json=626e17690a5a1cd7...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1046/j.1525-142x.2001.01039.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1080/106351599260454>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1086/303167>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1086/BBLv228n2p146> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-model-fidelity>,
