        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-audit-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-audit-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-2> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Pulsatile Peristaltic Kirchhoff Gastrovascular Flow Coupled to Shear-Stress-Gated Stolon Tip Outgrowth, Anastomosis Loop Closure, and Regression Across the Runner-to-Sheet Colony Morphospace" ;
