<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. & Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol. colonial hydroid pulsatile gastrovascular stolon network, anastomosis loop closure, and runner-to-sheet morphospace — Model fidelity to source: 54/100" ;
